control_assertion:
We plug in $x = 4$: \begin{align*}
3(4) + 2y &= 12\\
12 + 2y &= 12\\
y &= 0.
\end{align*}

recovery_assertion:
We plug in $x = 4$: \begin{align*}
3(4) - 2y &= 12\\
12 + 2y &= 12\\
y &= 0.
\end{align*}

